sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Flask API
    participant Model as Decision Tree
    participant Data as Dataset CSV

    Note over User, Data: Skenario: Prediksi Risiko Jantung

    User->>Browser: Buka http://localhost:5000
    Browser->>Frontend: Load index.html + CSS + JS
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/stats
    API->>Data: Read dataset_cleaned.csv
    Data-->>API: 27.817 records
    API-->>Frontend: JSON statistik
    Frontend-->>Browser: Render Dashboard + Charts

    User->>Browser: Klik menu "Prediksi Risiko"
    Browser->>Frontend: Show page prediksi

    User->>Frontend: Input: Usia=55, Gender=L, BMI=28, TD=145/90, Sesak=Ya
    User->>Frontend: Klik "Analisis Risiko Jantung"

    Frontend->>Frontend: Validasi input
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/predict {usia, gender, bmi, sistolik, diastolik, sesak}
    API->>Model: predict([55, 0, 1, 28, 145, 90])
    Model-->>API: prediction=1, probability=[0.35, 0.65]
    API->>Model: decision_path()
    Model-->>API: path=[usia>38.33, sistolik>124.5, ...]
    API-->>Frontend: JSON {prediction, probability, path}
    Frontend-->>Browser: Render hasil risiko + decision path
    Browser-->>User: Tampilkan: "RISIKO JANTUNG (65.0%)"

    Note over User, Data: Skenario: Lihat Data Pasien

    User->>Browser: Klik menu "Data Pasien"
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/patients?page=1&per_page=15
    API->>Data: Filter + Paginate
    Data-->>API: 15 records
    API-->>Frontend: JSON {data, total, pages}
    Frontend-->>Browser: Render tabel pasien

    User->>Frontend: Klik "Detail" pada pasien
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/patients/123
    API->>Data: Get patient by ID
    API->>Model: predict(patient features)
    Model-->>API: prediction + probability
    API-->>Frontend: JSON detail + prediksi
    Frontend-->>Browser: Show modal detail